================================================================================
Combined Work, Horizon SDK & Third-Party Notices (mod.wasm / .hmod archive)
================================================================================

The MIT License above applies to all original source code, language assets,
icons, manifests, and documentation of Momawd's Optimization Mod (`src/`,
`assets/`, `icon.png`, `Cargo.toml`, `horizon-mod.toml`, and `README.md`).

The precompiled `mod.wasm` binary distributed inside the `.hmod` package is a
Combined Work that links and incorporates compiled code from:

1. The pinned Horizon Mod SDK (`horizon-core`, `horizon-mod-api`,
   `horizon-mod-point-shape`, `horizon-mod-runtime`, and `horizon-mod-vocab`),
   from https://github.com/horizon-rust/horizon at commit
   `f037744a79f9982c47876f49c5a3067279f88706`, licensed under the GNU Lesser
   General Public License v3.0 or later (`LGPL-3.0-or-later`). Full texts of
   the GNU LGPL v3.0 and GNU GPL v3.0 are included in this archive as
   `LICENSE-LGPL-3.0` and `LICENSE-GPL-3.0`.
2. Sun Microsystems `fdlibm` 5.3 math routines adapted in
   `crates/horizon-core/src/jmath/fdlibm*`, `crates/horizon-core/src/geometry/trig.rs`,
   and the `libm` crate (Copyright (C) 1993, 2004 Sun Microsystems, Inc.).
3. The Rust 1.99.1 (`58cf8f9c35b355199727627d07ae34a4e2846d67`) standard, core,
   alloc, and `compiler_builtins` libraries (`MIT OR Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception`)
   and third-party Rust crates listed in `Cargo.lock` (`MIT`, `Apache-2.0`,
   `BSD-2-Clause`, `Zlib`, `Unlicense`, and `Unicode-3.0`).

Nothing in the MIT License above restricts, alters, or replaces any rights
granted to you under the licenses of the Horizon SDK or third-party components
(including your right under GNU LGPL v3.0 Section 4 to modify those components
and relink `mod.wasm` with the complete Mod source included in this archive).

See:
- `NOTICE` — full Horizon SDK, Sun `fdlibm`, Rust toolchain, `libm`/`musl`, and
  third-party crate copyright notices and permissive license texts;
- `LICENSE-LGPL-3.0` and `LICENSE-GPL-3.0` — GNU LGPL v3.0 and GNU GPL v3.0;
- `LICENSE-APACHE-2.0` — Apache License 2.0 (with LLVM Exception);
- `LICENSE-UNICODE-3.0` and `LICENSE-UNICODE-DFS-2016` — Unicode License v3 and
  Unicode Data Files and Software License (`Unicode-DFS-2016`);
- `README.md` — pinned Horizon SDK source commit, toolchain pin, and exact
  instructions to rebuild `mod.wasm` or relink against a modified Horizon SDK.
